				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p><strong>Hover over the LaserLab insignia on this graphic to explore how our treatments support different areas of the body.</strong></p>
<p>At LaserLab, we use the science of photobiomodulation, a form of light therapy that activates cellular energy and supports the body’s natural recovery process. This gentle, restorative light helps improve circulation, encourage new tissue growth, and enhance oxygen delivery throughout the body. The result is a system that feels recharged, balanced, and ready to heal itself from within.</p></div>
